abstract: >-
  A zero-Mathlib Lean 4.35.0 formalization (14 unconditional barrier, rigidity,
  phase-transition, and catalytic theorems verified across six independent kernels
  via lake check --paranoid and lake comparator --paranoid), exact-arithmetic and
  SAT-certified falsification bench, and 15-page AMS-LaTeX white paper auditing
  classical complexity barriers and twelve divergent pathways toward P vs. NP.
  P vs. NP remains completely open; no proof of P = NP or P != NP is claimed.
